# Tannuk, Steadfast Second's "Other creatures you control have haste" and "red creature cards in your hand have warp
# {2}{R}": Bot1's Memnite has haste and Tannuk itself does not ("other"); Grizzly Bears, a green creature card in Bot1's
# hand, has no warp; on Bot2's turn Bot2's Gray Ogre, a red creature, has no haste, and the Hill Giant in Bot2's hand has no
# warp (not "your hand" of Tannuk's controller). Refused even with mana to spare.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Tannuk, Steadfast Second
Memnite
Grizzly Bears
Mountain x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby x3
Gray Ogre
Hill Giant
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tannuk, Steadfast Second.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = Haste
? Bot1.Battlefield.Tannuk, Steadfast Second.Keywords = (absent)
! Bot1.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast(Ability: Warp)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#1.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#2.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#3.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Gray Ogre.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Gray Ogre.Keywords = (absent)
! Bot2.Hand.Hill Giant.Cast(Ability: Warp)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield = Mox Ruby; Mox Ruby; Mox Ruby; Gray Ogre
Bot2.Hand = Hill Giant; Island; Island; Island
